# What `walk --local` writes if you follow examples/README.md verbatim. The CLI
# never picks an output path itself — you name it — so this list only covers the
# names this repo suggests. Note there is no blanket *.html rule: e2e/fixture.html
# and the audit skill's fixtures are source, not output.
/signup.html
/checkout.html

# `walk --out` writes the request body here only if you name it so.
/payload.json

# The browser profile `walk` reuses lives in ~/.handoff/browser, outside the repo.
# `.handoff/walkthroughs/*.md` are plan files — those you probably want to commit.

.DS_Store
